	<Fragment slot="en">
		<h2>1. Who we are (Data Controller)</h2>
		<p>TrophyLog A/S ("TrophyLog", "we", "us") is the data controller for the personal data processed through the TrophyLog mobile app and related services.</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Company:</strong> TrophyLog A/S</li>
			<li><strong>CVR (business reg. no.):</strong> 31282241</li>
			<li><strong>Address:</strong> Sortebjergvej 6, 3200 Helsinge, Denmark</li>
			<li><strong>Contact / privacy enquiries:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@trophylog.com">contact@trophylog.com</a></li>
			<li><strong>Data Protection Officer:</strong> Martin Hobert — <a href="mailto:contact@trophylog.com">contact@trophylog.com</a></li>
		</ul>

		<h2>2. Scope</h2>
		<p>This policy explains what personal data we collect through the TrophyLog app, why we process it, the legal bases under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), who we share it with, how long we keep it, and your rights.</p>

		<h2>3. What data we collect and why</h2>
